<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 17 bln SKR 7-day T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 17 bln SKR 7-day T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Tuesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of seven-day Treasury bills worth 17 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on February 26, it said, and bids are due by 1000 GMT on February 25.</p>
<p>The paper will mature on March 5.</p>
<p>The lowest accepted bid volume is 100 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-101</p>
</text>
